OL,3,GNEWSABank fined #1.9m for money
OL,4,Alaundering failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Guernsey bank has been fined almost
OL,7,F#2m after "serious and systemic"
OL,8,Ffailings were found in its measures to
OL,9,Fprevent money laundering and the
OL,10,Ffunding of terrorist groups.
OL,12,FThe Guernsey Financial Services
OL,13,FCommission (GFSC) found Skipton
OL,14,FInternational had failed to carry out
OL,15,Fproper checks on more than 1,600
OL,16,Fcorporate accounts between November
OL,17,F2018 and May 2023.
OL,19,FSonia Zoe Dean, who was Skipton
OL,20,FInternational's money laundering
OL,21,Freporting officer during the period,
OL,22,Fwas also fined #28,000.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
